OL,3,GNEWSAFormer senior police officer
OL,4,Abelieves agent involved in Omagh bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police officer who headed up the
OL,7,FOmagh bomb investigation has told an
OL,8,Finquiry into the atrocity that he
OL,9,Fbelieves a covert agent was involved in
OL,10,Fthe bombing.
OL,12,FRetired PSNI Ch Supt Norman Baxter gave
OL,13,Fevidence to the inquiry sitting in
OL,14,FBelfast on Thursday.
OL,16,F"I believe, just for total clarity,
OL,17,Fthat one of the people who brought the
OL,18,Fbomb to Omagh on the day was an agent,"
OL,19,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
