OL,3,GNEWSAFormer senior police officer
OL,4,Abelieves agent involved in Omagh bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,7,Fpregnant with twins, died in the Real
OL,8,FIRA bombing in the County Tyrone town
OL,9,Fon 15 August 1998 - the biggest single
OL,10,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
